     },
     "to": {
      "pos": [
       7,
       1.7,
       1
      ],
      "look": [
       4,
       1,
       6
      ],
      "fov": 0.8
     }
    },
    "lines": [
     {
      "at": 0.8,
      "dur": 10.3,
      "text": "In the bell chamber at the top, a cabinet sealed in wax before the valley was flooded, so that someone, someday, would find it dry. Inside it, one page."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "dur": 13.1,
    "cam": {
     "from": {
      "pos": [
       4,
       2.3,
       3.5
      ],
      "look": [
       4,
       0.85,
       6
      ],
      "fov": 0.62
     },
     "to": {
      "pos": [
       4,
       2.0,
       4.3
      ],
      "look": [
       4,
       0.9,
       6
      ],
      "fov": 0.62
     }
    },
    "title": {
     "at": 0.4,
     "dur": 3.4,
     "text": "Seal it behind us."
    },
    "lines": [
     {
      "at": 3.8,
      "dur": 9.2,
      "text": "The last order the empire gave, written the night before it left, in a calm hand. They left on purpose, and locked the door themselves."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "dur": 10.8,
    "cam": {
     "from": {
      "pos": [
       -7,
       1.8,
       2
      ],
      "look": [
       -4,
       1,
       6
      ],
      "fov": 0.75
     },
     "to": {
      "pos": [
       -5.6,
       1.7,
       3.4
      ],
      "look": [
       -4,
       1,
       6
      ],
      "fov": 0.75
     }
    },
    "lines": [
     {
      "at": 0.6,
      "dur": 10.1,
      "text": "Beside it, the striking rolls: what the bell has rung each year since the flood. The peal changes yearly, and the gaps between strokes grow shorter."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "dur": 9.6,
    "fade": {
     "out": 1.6
    },
    "cam": {
     "from": {
      "pos": [
       6,
       1.6,
       -6
      ],
      "look": [
       0,
       9,
       0
      ],
      "fov": 0.9
     },
     "to": {
      "pos": [
       9,
       2.4,
       -9
      ],
      "look": [
       0,
       8,
       0
      ],
      "fov": 0.9
     }
    },
    "lines": [
     {
      "at": 0.6,
      "dur": 8.9,
      "text": "It was never a bell. It is a clock the size of a valley, and it is counting down to the date the empire wrote down for its return."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
