      "dur": 7.8,
      "text": "The Regent, from the walls: \"Travellers. You kept your watch at my door through the night, and you kept it well.\""
     },
     {
      "at": 8.6,
      "dur": 6.5,
      "text": "\"The household's law allows for an audit of its keeping, and I find that you have become one.\""
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "dur": 8.3,
    "cam": {
     "from": {
      "pos": [
       -14,
       4,
       -140
      ],
      "look": [
       0,
       12,
       -110
      ],
      "fov": 0.8
     },
     "to": {
      "pos": [
       -10,
       5,
       -136
      ],
      "look": [
       0,
       12,
       -110
      ],
      "fov": 0.8
     }
    },
    "lines": [
     {
      "at": 0.6,
      "dur": 7.6,
      "text": "\"At first light I will unbar the gates of the capital. Come in. Write down what you find. I have kept it well.\""
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "dur": 8.3,
    "cam": {
     "from": {
      "pos": {
       "npc": "morrow_gates",
       "off": [
        0.5,
        1.75,
        2.4
       ]
      },
      "look": {
       "npc": "morrow_gates",
       "off": [
        0,
        1.6,
        0
       ]
      },
      "fov": 0.6
     },
     "to": {
      "pos": {
       "npc": "morrow_gates",
       "off": [
        0.3,
        1.72,
        2.0
       ]
      },
      "look": {
       "npc": "morrow_gates",
       "off": [
        0,
        1.6,
        0
       ]
      },
      "fov": 0.6
     }
    },
    "lines": [
     {
      "at": 0.6,
      "dur": 7.6,
      "who": "npc:morrow_gates",
      "text": "Kept it well. Three hundred years alone in there with the dusting, and what it wants from us is a good report."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "dur": 7.6,
    "cam": {
     "from": {
      "pos": {
       "npc": "sabel_gates",
       "off": [
        1.3,
        1.15,
