      "text": "The Census Hall: the Hall of the Household, where the empire kept the register of every one of its people. Roll on roll, from the floor to the ceiling."
     }
    ],
    "cues": [
     {
      "at": 0,
      "who": "npc:sabel_census",
      "face": "self"
